The '''Shawda Ubb'''<ref name="DB" /> (also spelled '''Shawda-Ubb''')<ref name="CE" /> were a [[species]] of squat, green-skinned, potbellied [[Sentience|sentients]]. They had four thin [[limb]]s that ended in three digits apiece, and small heads whose faces sported heavy brow ridges.<ref name="RotJ" /> As an inborn defense mechanism, they were able to spit [[poison]].<ref name="AEYNTK" /> A famous Shawda Ubb was [[Rappertunie]], who played the [[Growdi Harmonique]] as a member of the [[Max Rebo Band]].<ref name="DB" />

